    "created_at": "2015-09-24T10:37:25Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-09-24T10:37:25Z",
    "body": "My main worry now is that while `WorkerLocation` objects are created, `WorkerNavigator` objects (and maybe others?) are not. However, we can fix them as we go I suppose. I would appreciate another quick look.\n",
